// Axon v7.0 Self-Hosted Compiler - Token, AST, Span, Type & Effect Definitions (`compiler_ax/tokens_ast.ax`)
// 100% Pure Axon, Zero GC, Zero External Crates. All hot helpers use <= 4 1-slot args (Fast Register ABI).

